= 4. Method in one paragraph per part

- *P1 (ECCp-131, full width, tier 1).* XL\/Macaulay engine (#raw("xl-incremental-sparse-echelon")) on the fixed bounded decomposition system, configs #raw("m2t3") and #raw("m3t2"), kinds null, planted and ladder. 58 arms: E0, an A\/A repeat, an A\/A permuted variable order-order arm, 1 isomorphic model, 27 Elkies neighbours, 27 random non-isogenous curves; 32 null targets, 8 planted targets, 3 reps, seed 20261102. Masked analysis frozen first, key opened after (A1 section 14).
- *P2 (prime analogues).* #raw("ecbench") prime-abscissa mitm pipeline on every curve of an enumerated class (D = -84171, h = 128 for class A; D = -414651, h = 300 for class B), m = 2 and 3. Per curve pooled relation yield per attempt; ICC curve share of variance, max\/min and max |z| against a 2000-permutation null; round-parity A\/A halves; isomorphic-model control; planted +20% positive control (power must be at least 0.9 for a null to be informative).
- *P3 (ECC2K-130).* #raw("p3h measure"): Weil-descended decomposition system over F\_2, recorded #raw("dreg") (resolving degree), exact #raw("solutions"), rows and cols, for random V, standard V and b-adapted presentations, at n = 43 (all 258 level curves plus E0) and n = 131 (E0 plus 262 level-263 curves), k = 3 to 6.


